      "statement": "build_assistant_graph() creates an AsyncPostgresSaver checkpointer from the configured database.url, requires the URL to begin with postgresql:// or postgresql+psycopg://, fails fast when it does not, and returns the compiled graph together with its async checkpoint connection.",
